+# ── Feedback Lab: A/B packaging tests + post-publish Studio check-ins ──────
+# Closes the publish → measure → learn loop. ab_tests tracks each published
+# video's Studio title/thumbnail experiment; ab_checkins stores the metrics
+# read out of the morning-after Studio screenshot. _feedback_learnings()
+# digests both into the AI Final Review prompts on the Publish page.
+
